ocument_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012511103:0":{"text":"マスター、あの魔法を覚えていますか？","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF90A034BED29113","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012511104:0":{"text":"流光の樹の下で、テレポート魔法を使ってイミルを逃がしたのも、きっと彼女です！","source_cn":"在流荧树下用传送魔法把伊米尔救走的人，肯定也是她！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x039D8C5EAD15640B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012511105:0":{"text":"ブラックゴールド商会……金麦村の次はユグドラシルの生命力を狙うなんて、奴らの目的はいったい……？","source_cn":"黑金商会……先是金穗村，又是薄暮丛林的生命力，他们到底...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC719D91DECB16C03","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ブラックゴールド商会……金麦村の次はユグドラシルの生命力を狙うなんて、奴らの目的はいったい……？","female":"ブラックゴールド商会……金麦村の次はユグドラシルの生命力を狙うなんて、奴らの目的はいったい……？","variant_male_record_index":"111803","variant_female_record_index":"111804","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"クイン","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:主角":{"text":"主人公","source":"主角","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":3}},"kr":{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10125111","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10125111","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1012511101:0":{"text":"이미르 이 나쁜 자식! 정면으로 맞서지도 못하면서 도망은 엄청 빨리 가네!","source_cn":"伊米尔那个混蛋！不敢正面和我们对峙，跑得倒是比谁都快！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FCC47060F908170","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1012511102:0":{"text":"조금 전에 이미르와 대화하던 여인이 텔레포트 마법을 썼어요!","source_cn":"刚才咱们看到的那个和伊米尔谈话的女士，她用了传送魔法！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA1FC4B5AD4898E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012511103:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 그 마법 기억하세요?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF90A034BED29113","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012511104:0":{"text":"황혼의 나무 아래에서 텔레포트 마법으로 이미르를 구한 사람... 분명 그 여인이었을 거예요!","source_cn":"在流荧树下用传送魔法把伊米尔救走的人，肯定也是她！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x039D8C5EAD15640B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012511105:0":{"text":"블랙골드 상회... 금빛이삭 마을에, 땅거미 숲의 생명력까지. 대체 무슨 일을 꾸미고 있는 걸까?","source_cn":"黑金商会……先是金穗村，又是薄暮丛林的生命力，他们到底...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC719D91DECB16C03","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"블랙골드 상회... 금빛이삭 마을에, 땅거미 숲의 생명력까지. 대체 무슨 일을 꾸미고 있는 걸까?","female":"블랙골드 상회... 금빛이삭 마을에, 땅거미 숲의 생명력까지. 대체 무슨 일을 꾸미고 있는 걸까?","variant_male_record_index":"111803","variant_female_record_index":"111804","document_title":"","documen